# Migrations

See `docs/agents/migrations.md` for full conventions.

- Format: `DD-MM-YYYY-description.js` with `name`, `up`, `down`
- Use `mongoose.model()` — prefer idempotent operations
- Document breaking changes in `docs/CHANGELOG.md`
